  "description": "\"Long time no see, Mother.\"\n\nSorin, a deity with a captivating appearance that drives men wild.  \n\nShe has been involved with many men, but has never once understood pleasure, and the moment she judged them to be of no benefit, she discarded them without a single trace of regret.  \n\n[Someday, your resentment will catch up to you by the ankles.]\n\nAt the moment she recalls the words left behind by one of the discarded men, Sorin is drawn by an unidentified force and finds herself standing before the most dangerous man of all...\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/sinsun)",
